From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert Beckett <bob.beckett@collabora.com>
Date: Thu, 21 Aug 2025 19:03:06 +0100
Subject: [FOR-UPSTREAM] leds: rgb: add leds-valve driver

Add initial support for Valve LED strip

Fix CnP error breaking enabled_store (non-final version of patch was
inadvertently pushed)

Fix caching OFF as the bootup state resulting in `enable` node not
working (select a explicit effect still works)

Fix comment style

`delay range` indicate the valid range of values for the `delay` attribute.

Signed-off-by: Robert Beckett <bob.beckett@collabora.com>
(cherry picked from commit 50e3efc58b078a31c357ed91231ec15f7541e2f7)
Signed-off-by: John Schoenick <johns@valvesoftware.com>
