From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antheas Kapenekakis <lkml@antheas.dev>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 20:14:42 +0200
Subject: platform/x86: lenovo-wmi-other: Add full fan speed attribute

The Other Mode fan feature 0x04020000 controls the firmware full-speed
fan mode. Its Capability Data 00 entry describes whether the feature and
its get and set operations are supported.

Expose the feature as fan_full_speed under firmware-attributes when the
capability entry is valid and a live value probe succeeds. Limit values to
the firmware-defined boolean range.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6-sol
Signed-off-by: Antheas Kapenekakis <lkml@antheas.dev>
---
 .../wmi/devices/lenovo-wmi-other.rst          |   3 +
