From: Antheas Kapenekakis <lkml@antheas.dev>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:33:19 +0200
Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: Correct Galaxy Book4 Edge 14/16 hardware

Use the canonical X1E board description for the shared 14-inch and
16-inch hardware. Replace PMIC GLINK with the two Samsung S2MM006 USB-C
controllers, connect their endpoint graphs and enable USB role switching.
Add the ENE KB9058 battery controller and correct the touchscreen IRQ and
pinctrl to GPIO 34.

Describe the stereo WSA8835 speakers and their audio routes in place of
the four WSA8845 speakers. Keep the existing per-board panel and touchpad
nodes, and add EL2 DTB targets for both sizes.

Validation: both base and EL2 DTBs build; compiled hardware properties
match the canonical reference with each board's panel and touchpad.

Fixes: f65d79a89dfe ("arm64: dts: qcom: Add hamoa Samsung Galaxy Book4 Edge devicetrees")
