From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antheas Kapenekakis <lkml@antheas.dev>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:34:21 +0200
Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: Add Galaxy Book4 Edge 15.6-inch X1P42100

Add the NP750XQB as the 15-inch Galaxy Book4 Edge derivative using Purwa
and the shared board core. Describe its PWM backlight, PS8830 retimers,
eUSB repeaters, microSD slot, touchpad and stereo WSA8845 speakers from
the canonical board reference.

Keep the X1P-specific firmware paths, display audio links and USB PHY
wiring. Add the board compatible and both base and EL2 DTB targets.

Validation: both DTBs build; compiled hardware properties and reciprocal
endpoint graphs match the canonical NP750XQB reference.

Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-6
