Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: galaxy-book4-edge: disable bias on eDP HPD pin

The shared X1E Galaxy Book4 Edge pin configuration adds bias-pull-down
on top of the bias-disable property inherited from the SoC device tree.
This leaves conflicting bias settings and triggers the pinctrl warning
"cannot have multiple bias configurations" during boot.

