From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:06:11 +0700
Subject: drm/panel: add Ilitek IL97680A based panels

Add a driver for DSI panels built on the Ilitek IL97680A driver IC,
starting with the 1280x960 command mode panel of the RetroidPocket RP
Nova, also used as the bottom display of the RetroidPocket Duo. The
panel supports 60 and 120 Hz, selected through the init sequence from
the mode the CRTC is configured with, and its brightness is controlled
over DCS.

Signed-off-by: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
---
