From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:37:58 +0700
Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: add Retroid Pocket 6

Add the device tree for the Retroid Pocket 6, based on the common
QCS8550 Retroid Pocket dtsi, with the board-specific parts:

- DSI panel (Visionox VTDR6130 based) with FocalTech FT5452
  touchscreen
- Joystick RGB lights (two HEROIC HTR3212)
- Gamepad stick range

Signed-off-by: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile             |   1 +
 .../dts/qcom/qcs8550-retroidpocket-rp6.dts    | 292 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 293 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-retroidpocket-rp6.dts

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
index adad76be01ceddd545b6b8ae2f84669f8d6752f4..af00ab4079022e311724a7029bf3daf585fbffb0 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
@@ -194,6 +194,7 @@ qcs8300-ride-el2-dtbs := qcs8300-ride.dtb monaco-el2.dtbo
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= qcs8300-ride-el2.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= qcs8550-aim300-aiot.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= qcs8550-rb5gen2.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= qcs8550-retroidpocket-rp6.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= qcs9100-ride.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= qcs9100-ride-r3.dtb
 
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-retroidpocket-rp6.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-retroidpocket-rp6.dts
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..100db3df8f0b252066d8fc9db7c39ec066d02fcd
