From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:44:47 +0700
Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: add Retroid Pocket Duo

The Retroid Pocket Duo is a dual-screen handheld gaming device based on
the Qualcomm Eliza platform. Add its device tree, based on the common
Eliza Retroid Pocket dtsi, with the board-specific parts:

- Top DSI panel (Visionox VTDR6130 based) on DSI0 and bottom DSI panel
  (Ilitek IL97680A based) on DSI1, with their supplies
- Two FocalTech FT5452 touchscreens, one per panel
- Firmware paths for the GPU zap shader, ADSP, CDSP, WPSS and the
  speaker amplifiers

Signed-off-by: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile             |   1 +
 .../dts/qcom/eliza-retroidpocket-rpduo.dts    | 334 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 335 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/eliza-retroidpocket-rpduo.dts

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
index 06c06ef76d1760cf708063bf9e42654da58e8f56..211d9df928863a0f49575722c16d1a4731a0889e 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
@@ -16,6 +16,7 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= apq8096sg-db820c.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= apq8096-ifc6640.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= eliza-cqs-evk.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= eliza-mtp.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= eliza-retroidpocket-rpduo.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= glymur-crd.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= hamoa-iot-evk.dtb
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/eliza-retroidpocket-rpduo.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/eliza-retroidpocket-rpduo.dts
new file mode 100644
